    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc95ONANI\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udc4c</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.poster.avif?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.webm?t=1753163963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/605111d9db17a570db40d31b2a8bb2f6.mp4?t=1753163963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1753163963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/9da417cb0109d913e96a46ede39ec566.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=45 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains: A significant amount of graphic scenes including <u><strong>dismemberment, dissections, and other bloody scenes</strong></u> that may cause discomfort.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a <u><strong>fully dubbed fantasy visual novel for gore lovers</strong></u> to savor the delicate text that describes the protagonist's inner despair, the exquisite event pictures full of flesh and blood, and the emotional voice acting.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/487389a8416136eabd0d6c002b32efaf.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sera\uff08CV\u85e4\u6751\u8389\u592e\uff09, a novice adventurer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it's about time my party members recognize my strength at this age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/dc955591ea1d65ccbaea8c6913437dd9.avif?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gain experience, Sera ventures into the maze by her own, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when suddenly the floor disappears, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dropping her into an unknown place she has never seen before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, awaiting her, will be inhumane treatment beyond imagination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/1439a51493ad3d11e38b628c3e43c786.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a macabre text adventure game, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where your choices throughout the story will determine the protagonist's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/9f92f32adc3e1bd176e2518828476f62.avif?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 7 endings, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including a flashback room, CG appreciation, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and full voice acting for the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/63c593c1cddb84165dcca04684de08bd.avif?t=1753163963\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/9da417cb0109d913e96a46ede39ec566.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=45 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains: A significant amount of graphic scenes including <u><strong>dismemberment, dissections, and other bloody scenes</strong></u> that may cause discomfort.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is a <u><strong>fully dubbed fantasy visual novel for gore lovers</strong></u> to savor the delicate text that describes the protagonist's inner despair, the exquisite event pictures full of flesh and blood, and the emotional voice acting.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/487389a8416136eabd0d6c002b32efaf.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sera\uff08CV\u85e4\u6751\u8389\u592e\uff09, a novice adventurer, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but it's about time my party members recognize my strength at this age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/dc955591ea1d65ccbaea8c6913437dd9.avif?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gain experience, Sera ventures into the maze by her own, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when suddenly the floor disappears, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dropping her into an unknown place she has never seen before. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There, awaiting her, will be inhumane treatment beyond imagination...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/1439a51493ad3d11e38b628c3e43c786.webp?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a macabre text adventure game, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >where your choices throughout the story will determine the protagonist's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799940/extras/9f92f32adc3e1bd176e2518828476f62.avif?t=1753163963\" width=616 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 7 endings, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >including a flashback room, CG appreciation, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and full voice acting for the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
